Table full name: HTAN_2.HTAN.SCRNASEQ_MSK_SCLC_EPITHELIAL_CELLS_CURRENT
Column name: sex Type: TEXT Description: Phenotypic sex
Column name: cell_type Type: TEXT Description: The type of cell (i.e. T-cell)
Column name: clusters Type: NUMBER Description: The coarse grained cluster labels placed on each cell, relates to cell type and state.
Column name: development_stage Type: TEXT Description: Human development stage derived from HsapDv term  (Example if data is Homo sapiens, development stage is obtained from Link. HsapDv:0000114 - 20-year-old human stage)
